{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216110","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721611001:1":{"text":"格温妮丝！真没想到你会主动约我们！自从你当了守备军的队长，我们就很少见到你了。","source_cn":"格温妮丝！真没想到你会主动约我们！自从你当了守备军的队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75EB3A9E3B7E9B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721611002:1":{"text":"上次的花卉鉴赏你也没来，大家都说你现在可是赛凡纳最难请的人呢。","source_cn":"上次的花卉鉴赏你也没来，大家都说你现在可是赛凡纳最难请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E19A4C9B3C30F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721611003:2":{"text":"抱歉，凯瑟琳，我也很想念大家。只是，军务确实繁重……","source_cn":"抱歉，凯瑟琳，我也很想念大家。只是，军务确实繁重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F00808AAC88895E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721611004:1":{"text":"哼，军务。亲爱的，我真是不明白，你放着好好的贵族小姐不当，非要去男人堆里打滚……","source_cn":"哼，军务。亲爱的，我真是不明白，你放着好好的贵族小姐不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F2250C753AE637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721611005:1":{"text":"我父亲说，守备军驻地又脏又乱，全是汗臭味。你看看你的手，是不是都变粗糙了？","source_cn":"我父亲说，守备军驻地又脏又乱，全是汗臭味。你看看你的手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359411E3C04BB25F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721611006:1":{"text":"现在的风头虽然盛，但这对淑女的名声可没什么好处。","source_cn":"现在的风头虽然盛，但这对淑女的名声可没什么好处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3A5C4A713BE201C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721611007:3":{"text":"卡罗琳……其实、其实我觉得格温妮丝现在穿铠甲的样子很帅气！","source_cn":"卡罗琳……其实、其实我觉得格温妮丝现在穿铠甲的样子很帅气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5244F77ABA9169C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721611008:0":{"text":"那又如何？将来又有哪位公爵愿意娶一个这样的妻子？","source_cn":"那又如何？将来又有哪位公爵愿意娶一个这样的妻子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994A1F80654756A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721611009:1":{"text":"个人的选择罢了。说起来，最近王都不太平。圣古堂的事情，你们在家都有听到什么风声吗？","source_cn":"个人的选择罢了。说起来，最近王都不太平。圣古堂的事情，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x553B70998B3FC6D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721611010:1":{"text":"听到这个话题，三个女孩的表情瞬间变得精彩起来，纷纷凑近了一些。","source_cn":"听到这个话题，三个女孩的表情瞬间变得精彩起来，纷纷凑近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A126255D4CE57CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t